{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/85018673c0a4578164aed0e0c5daa1d5.poster.avif?t=1768951457\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/85018673c0a4578164aed0e0c5daa1d5.webm?t=1768951457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/85018673c0a4578164aed0e0c5daa1d5.mp4?t=1768951457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Misspell</strong> is a 2D Metroidvania, set on the remote island of Melanor \u2014 a place where ancient magic and a mysterious disaster have changed everything. After a strange mineral wiped out a whole civilization, only ruins, echoes of the past, and a strange power remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a girl whose arm is wrapped in a <strong>living magical vine</strong>. It absorbs energy from artifacts and transforms into new abilities, letting you reach new areas and fight in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/134418e4ffcb530579ead334b8f6f954.poster.avif?t=1768951457\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/134418e4ffcb530579ead334b8f6f954.webm?t=1768951457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/134418e4ffcb530579ead334b8f6f954.mp4?t=1768951457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through hand-drawn biomes \u2014 from foggy banks to snowy mountain peaks. Discover mines, forests, temples, and ruins full of traps, secrets, and enemies hiding pieces of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/4e7188062587f3ee6fa21bca1a8f266b.poster.avif?t=1768951457\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/4e7188062587f3ee6fa21bca1a8f266b.webm?t=1768951457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/4e7188062587f3ee6fa21bca1a8f266b.mp4?t=1768951457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your vine evolves with you \u2014 improve skills and collect ancient artifacts that will help in fights with various creatures and exploration of the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/08e5e34dcbc2b0c0777f49ed3c003960.avif?t=1768951457\" width=800 height=713 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet different characters with their own stories, and make choices that change the island and the people who live there.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo in Progress:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re working hard on the first playable demo. Player feedback will help shape the final game \u2014 with more features, characters, locations, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3235850?t=1768951457","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768951457","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/f916e8e33fe3bb6b1c9e9966f9c43a0d5ae62cd6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768951457","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/f916e8e33fe3bb6b1c9e9966f9c43a0d5ae62cd6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768951457","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3235860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/85018673c0a4578164aed0e0c5daa1d5.poster.avif?t=1768951457\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/85018673c0a4578164aed0e0c5daa1d5.webm?t=1768951457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/85018673c0a4578164aed0e0c5daa1d5.mp4?t=1768951457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Misspell</strong> is a 2D Metroidvania, set on the remote island of Melanor \u2014 a place where ancient magic and a mysterious disaster have changed everything. After a strange mineral wiped out a whole civilization, only ruins, echoes of the past, and a strange power remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a girl whose arm is wrapped in a <strong>living magical vine</strong>. It absorbs energy from artifacts and transforms into new abilities, letting you reach new areas and fight in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/134418e4ffcb530579ead334b8f6f954.poster.avif?t=1768951457\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/134418e4ffcb530579ead334b8f6f954.webm?t=1768951457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/134418e4ffcb530579ead334b8f6f954.mp4?t=1768951457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through hand-drawn biomes \u2014 from foggy banks to snowy mountain peaks. Discover mines, forests, temples, and ruins full of traps, secrets, and enemies hiding pieces of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/4e7188062587f3ee6fa21bca1a8f266b.poster.avif?t=1768951457\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/4e7188062587f3ee6fa21bca1a8f266b.webm?t=1768951457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/4e7188062587f3ee6fa21bca1a8f266b.mp4?t=1768951457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your vine evolves with you \u2014 improve skills and collect ancient artifacts that will help in fights with various creatures and exploration of the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/08e5e34dcbc2b0c0777f49ed3c003960.avif?t=1768951457\" width=800 height=713 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet different characters with their own stories, and make choices that change the island and the people who live there.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo in Progress:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re working hard on the first playable demo. Player feedback will help shape the final game \u2014 with more features, characters, locations, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Bones Keeper Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/e6fbaab822cfb8d9abab2ab9631891ee1c598379/header.jpg?t=1768951457","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3235850/688977324/f7838dd46adb99b204fbea939201b7c3a9f38f8f/1755355530/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755582676","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3235850/688977324/f7838dd46adb99b204fbea939201b7c3a9f38f8f/1755355530/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755582676","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3235850/688977324/f7838dd46adb99b204fbea939201b7c3a9f38f8f/1755355530/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755582676","id":257184158,"name":"Demo Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184158/7fe08fffb3ea509f231e1712b8a68964829b93f2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755582676"}],"name":"Misspell","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 4460 / AMD Athlon X4<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 950 / AMD R7 370<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 Skylake / AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 970 / AMD RX 570<br></li><li><stro